### Listar todos os quartos
GET http://localhost:7070/rooms

### Criar uma reserva
POST http://localhost:7070/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomNumber": "101",
  "guestName": "João Silva",
  "guestEmail": "joao@example.com",
  "guestCpf": "12345678901",
  "checkIn": "2027-03-10",
  "checkOut": "2027-03-12",
  "guests": 2,
  "ratePlan": "STANDARD"
}

### Criar reserva não reembolsável (com desconto)
POST http://localhost:7070/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomNumber": "201",
  "guestName": "Maria Santos",
  "guestEmail": "maria@example.com",
  "guestCpf": "98765432109",
  "checkIn": "2027-07-15",
  "checkOut": "2027-07-17",
  "guests": 2,
  "ratePlan": "NON_REFUNDABLE"
}

### Consultar uma reserva
GET http://localhost:7070/reservations/1

### Confirmar uma reserva (envia emails)
POST http://localhost:7070/reservations/1/confirmation

### Fazer check-in
POST http://localhost:7070/reservations/1/check-in

### Fazer check-out (retorna comprovante)
POST http://localhost:7070/reservations/1/check-out

### Obter segunda via do comprovante
GET http://localhost:7070/reservations/1/document

### Cancelar uma reserva
POST http://localhost:7070/reservations/1/cancellation

### Listar todas as mensagens enviadas
GET http://localhost:7070/messages

### Relatório de ocupação para uma data
GET http://localhost:7070/reports/occupancy?date=2027-07-15

### Relatório financeiro de um mês
GET http://localhost:7070/reports/revenue?month=2027-07

### Teste de erro - quarto não existe
POST http://localhost:7070/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomNumber": "999",
  "guestName": "Teste",
  "guestEmail": "teste@example.com",
  "guestCpf": "12345678901",
  "checkIn": "2027-03-10",
  "checkOut": "2027-03-12",
  "guests": 2,
  "ratePlan": "STANDARD"
}

### Teste de erro - capacidade excedida
POST http://localhost:7070/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomNumber": "101",
  "guestName": "Teste",
  "guestEmail": "teste@example.com",
  "guestCpf": "12345678901",
  "checkIn": "2027-03-10",
  "checkOut": "2027-03-12",
  "guests": 5,
  "ratePlan": "STANDARD"
}
